{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["To LOVE-Ru OVA","Episode 1: Rito becomes a Woman\n\nLala invents a gizmo to make her bust bigger. However, this invention of hers accidentally turns Rito into a woman.\n\n\n\nEpisode 2: Rito and Mikan\n\nFeeling lonely because Rito is always spending time with Lala, Mikan storms out of the house. While Rito and Lala are out looking for her, a few flashbacks from the past showing Rito and Mikan as kids are shown.\n\n\n\nEpisode 3: Welcome to the Southern Resort!!\n\nHaruna wins an island resort trip for ten females. Rito gets turned into a dog by one of Lala's inventions and somehow ends up on the island as well.\n\n\n\nEpisode 4: Trouble Quest\n\nRito and the girls become trapped inside an RPG game where the objective is to save Lala and defeat the evil witch Kyouko.\n\n\n\nEpisode 5: Nana and Momo\n\nLala's sisters cause mischief for Rito and his harem at a cherry blossom viewing.\n\n\n\nEpisode 6: Draft, Metamorphose, Hand & Tail\n\nYami and Yui confront with a senior, causing Yui to lose her panties; Mikan finds Peke taking snapshots of new clothing while shopping. Suddenly, a stranger steals her bag; As Rito tries to explore Lala's cleaned-up bedroom, he accidentally activates one of Lala's inventions, fusing his hand to Lala's tail."],"ja":["To LOVEる -とらぶる-",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":3455,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":9181,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-5667","ids":{"shikimori":5667,"mal":5667,"anilist":5667,"kodik":"serial-35511"},"kodikIds":["serial-6532","serial-35511"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-6532":"2020-01-02T00:04:51Z","serial-35511":"2021-06-28T14:42:09Z"},"title":"Любовные неприятности OVA","originalTitle":"To Love-Ru: Trouble OVA","alt":"To LOVEる -とらぶる- OVA To LOVEる -とらぶる-","description":"Эпизод 1: « ] превращается в девушку». Лала создаёт вещь, увеличивающую грудь, но как всегда её изобретения работают неправильно, отчего Рито случайно превращается в девушку. Эпизод 2: « ] и ]». Микан одиноко, так как Рито проводит всё свободное время с Лалой, поэтому она решает убежать из дома. Эпизод 3: «Добро пожаловать на курорт!» Харуна выигрывает поездку на остров для десятерых девушек, Рито превращается в собаку из-за изобретения Лалы и попадает на курорт вместе с остальными. Эпизод 4: «Проблемный квест». Рито вместе с девушками попадает в RPG-игру, цель которой — спасти Лалу и победить Кёко . Эпизод 5: «Нана и Момо ». Сёстры Лалы устраивают переполох во время наблюдения за цветующей сакурой. Эпизод 6 состоит из трёх частей: 1). «План» 2). «Метаморфоза» 3). «Рука и хвост»","year":2009,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Комедия","Романтика","Фантастика","этти","гарем","Школа"],"rating":7.24,"popularity":41560,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[3455,9181],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/5667/11a74b3e9c01a4c1a9f8f92d57d4bef8.jpeg","width":400,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5667-su9csSfBb5cI.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-6532","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/174165/ad852252f9c9111fd3c3c6e58c2bfc27/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-963","dubId":"963","label":"Amazing Dubbing","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-35511","translationId":"963","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/850452/d4f79bb31e5557ccf0601485d629fddf/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","origi